<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第二幕 · HARNESS 里头</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>提议权可以交给模型，执行权必须留在 harness</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 384, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 32px", background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#A32D2D"}}>独立</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 10}}>检查方不能是提议方</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 744, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 18}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 18, alignItems: "center"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", gap: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>提议</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)"}}>模型 / Loop / Graph 给出下一步动作</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 3, height: 64, background: "#A32D2D"}}></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", gap: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#A32D2D"}}>检查</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)"}}>权限 + 确定性门禁独立判断</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 3, height: 64, background: "#0F6E56"}}></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", gap: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#0F6E56"}}>执行</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)"}}>放行或拒绝，并留下记录</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", font